    {
     "kind": "steps",
     "step": "method",
     "title": "3/5, 4/9, 7/3, 5/6, 11/18",
     "steps": [
      "The denominators are 5, 9, 3, 6 and 18. Their LCM is 90.",
      "3/5 = (3 × 18)/(5 × 18) = 54/90, because 90 ÷ 5 = 18.",
      "4/9 = (4 × 10)/(9 × 10) = 40/90, because 90 ÷ 9 = 10.",
      "7/3 = (7 × 30)/(3 × 30) = 210/90, because 90 ÷ 3 = 30.",
      "5/6 = (5 × 15)/(6 × 15) = 75/90, because 90 ÷ 6 = 15.",
      "11/18 = (11 × 5)/(18 × 5) = 55/90, because 90 ÷ 18 = 5.",
      "Order the numerators: 40 < 54 < 55 < 75 < 210.",
      "So 4/9 < 3/5 < 11/18 < 5/6 < 7/3."
     ],
